00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.780
knowledge capability simply tells that

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:33.780
when you train an LLM

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:40.780
then how much knowledge he was able to retain from his training process

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:45.780
basically how much world knowledge is hidden in his weights and biases

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:50.780
his parametric knowledge is a way to test knowledge capability

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.780
and this is the most important capability

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.780
think about it

00:16:54.780 --> 00:17:00.780
when the LLMs were trained for the first time on this massive internet scale data

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.780
then the expectation would be that

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:06.780
if we ask about anything on the internet then it will tell us

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:12.780
so knowledge capability is like the most fundamental capability that an LLM can have

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:16.780
the rest of the capabilities came into the picture slowly

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:17.780
like reasoning happened

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:19.780
reasoning was like an emergent behavior

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.780
that as we started increasing the scale

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:26.780
our models started reasoning step by step

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:29.780
similarly if you talk about coding

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:32.780
