00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:36.780
that when we feed a lot of coding programs

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.780
then it started writing programs to us

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.780
so what I am trying to say is

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.780
that when the LLMs were trained for the first time

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:50.780
the most fundamental expectation that LLMs should have was knowledge

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:52.780
that if we are giving them so much training data

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.780
then on the basis of that, are they able to retain it or not

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:57.780
so this capability represents that

00:17:57.780 --> 00:17:59.780
now what is here

